msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: introduction.docbook:5
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This user manual is intended to describe the contents and use of the "
#| "&sflphone-client-kde; &sflphonerelease; softphone. &sflphone-client-kde; "
#| "is a &kde; client for &sflphone;. It communicates with the core side, "
#| "sflphone daemon, through &DBus;. &sflphone; is meant to be a robust "
#| "enterprise-class desktop phone. It provides functions like call transfer, "
#| "call hold, multiple lines, multiple accounts support. It is SIP and IAX2 "
#| "compatible. &sflphone; audio layer is built upon a native ALSA interface "
#| "and a native PulseAudio interface."
msgid ""
"This user manual is intended to describe the contents and use of the &ring-"
"kde; &ringrelease; softphone. &ring-kde; is a &kde; client for &Ring;. It "
"communicates with the core side, Ring daemon, through &DBus;. &Ring; is "
"meant to be a robust enterprise-class desktop phone. It provides functions "
"like call transfer, call hold, multiple lines, multiple accounts support. It "
"is SIP and IAX2 compatible. &Ring; audio layer is built upon a native ALSA "
"interface and a native PulseAudio interface."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj korisnički priručnik je namijenjen na opiše  &sflphone-client-kde; "
"&sflphonerelease; softphone. &sflphone-client-kde; je &kde; klijent za "
"&sflphone;. On komunicira s osnovnom stranom,  sflphone demonim, kroz "
"&DBus;. &sflphone; je namijenjen da bude robustan stoni telefon za "
"preduzeća. Pruža funkcije poput prijenosa poziva, zadržavanja poziva, "
"višestrukih linija i podršku za više naloga.  On je SIP i IAX2 kompatibilab. "
"&sflphone; audio sloj je sagrađen iznad prirodnog ALSA interfejsa i "
"prirodnog PulseAudio interfejsa."
